			(property "Description" "Genaric Mechanical Mounting Hole\nHole diameter based on max body diameter + 15%\nKeepout ring is for diameter of socket cap screw (minimum required clearance)\nTPlace ring is for diameter of pan head screw (recomended clearance)\n•  Specifications:\n\n• Socket Cap\n• Button Head Socket Cap\n• Pan Head"
				(at 0 0 0)
